# Data Directory

This directory contains the datasets used in the ALL/AML leukemia subtype classification project.

## Purpose
The data is used for exploratory data analysis (EDA), data preprocessing, and gene expression-based classification of Acute Lymphoblastic Leukemia (ALL) and Acute Myeloid Leukemia (AML).

## Data Files
The CSV files used in this project will be stored in this directory.

## Notes
- The datasets will be examined before model development.
- Data preprocessing steps will be documented during the project.
- Dataset sources and relevant references will be provided in the main project README.

